# Brand Lock — Theme, Color, Fonts

When polishing storefront UI (glass, layout, contrast, spacing):

- **Do NOT** change brand theme colors, CTA tokens, or font families.
- **Keep:** Anton / Inter / Space Mono via `--font-sp-display`, `--font-sp-body`, `--font-sp-mono`.
- **Keep:** CTA lilac `--sp-cta-bg` (`#eadfed`), hover `--sp-cta-hover-bg` (`#ddb7ff`), text `--sp-cta-text` (`#16111b`).
- **Keep:** ink `#16111b` / muted `#5c5663` for light-mode text hierarchy.
- Glassmorphism = opacity + blur + border/shadow only — not new accent hues.
- Prefer fixing contrast with frosted plates / overlays, not recoloring product imagery or brand marks.
